\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. FOR LOCATION OF VIEW E-E, SEE SHEET B4-5 (PLAN). SECTIONS F-F AND G-G ARE LOCATED IN VIEW E-E.\P2. VIEW E-E AND SECTIONS F-F AND G-G SHOW THE LEFT CHEEK WALL; THE RIGHT CHEEK WALL IS SIMILAR (MIRRORED). THE RECESSED PANEL IS ON THE O
  3
UTSIDE FACE OF EACH CHEEK WALL; THE INSIDE FACE IS FLAT.\P3. CAP REINFORCEMENT IS NOT SHOWN IN SECTION F-F FOR CLARITY.\P4. CHEEK WALLS ARE CAST ON THE CAP; THE CAP TOP IS A CONSTRUCTION JOINT.\P5. CHEEK WALL VERTICALS 4E1 ARE EMBEDDED 1'-0" (MIN.) I
  1
NTO THE CAP, STRAIGHT; SEE SECTION F-F.\P6. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-13.
