  3
\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. TYP BAR AND STY ARE THE BAR TYPE AND HOOK STYLE OF STANDARD PLANS INDEX 415-001 (FY 2026-27): TYPE 1 STRAIGHT (B = LENGTH); TYPE 10 L-BAR (B = LONG LEG, C = SHORT LEG); TYPE 11 U-BAR (B = BASE, C AND D = LEGS); TYPE 5 OPEN STIRRUP (B
  3
 = HEIGHT, C = WIDTH, D AND E = FEET); TYPE 4 CLOSED STIRRUP (B = HEIGHT, C = WIDTH); STYLE 5 = 135° STIRRUP HOOKS.\P2. FIELD BEND OPEN STIRRUP HOOKS AS REQUIRED TO CLEAR PILE HEAD LOCATION.\P3. LENGTHS ARE THE MODEL CENTERLINE LENGTHS ROUNDED TO THE
  3
 NEAREST INCH; BEND DIMENSIONS ARE OUT-TO-OUT (SDM 4.3.10.C).\P4. MODEL CHECK (REMOVE BEFORE ISSUE): END BENT 1 4E1, END BENT 2 4E1 ARE STRAIGHT IN THE CAD MODEL AND ARE LISTED AS TYPE 1; THEY ARE TO BE TYPE 10 L-BARS. ADD THE LEGS TO THE MODEL.\P5. 
  1
VARYING LENGTHS: END BENT 1 5D1: 8 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2". END BENT 2 5D1: 8 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2".\P6. PILES AND THE CHEEK LUG WELDED WIRE REINFORCEMENT ARE NOT INCLUDED IN THIS LIST.
